        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.806,
            0.821,
            0.827
          ],
          "content": "Figs. (i), (ii), and (iii) are quadrilaterals, and the others are not. Why?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.831,
            0.848,
            0.868
          ],
          "content": "**The angles** of a quadrilateral are the angles between its sides, as marked in Figs. (i), (ii), and (iii)."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.867,
            0.848,
            0.907
          ],
          "content": "We will start with the most familiar quadrilaterals — rectangles and squares."
        },
